  "description": "Section 73 @ 18 Clive Rd for Larger Sliding Doors and Omission of Window",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Matching Materials</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials used in the development hereby\r\npermitted shall match those of the existing building in materials, style,\r\ncolour, texture and, in the case of brickwork, bonding, coursing and pointing.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with policies D12.1 and D12.3 of\r\nthe Local Plan 2024.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span>﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">EX-00,</span></p><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">EX-01,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-01,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-02 - Rev.A,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-03 - Rev.A,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-04 - Rev.A,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-05,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-06 - Rev.A,</span></div><div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PL-07,</span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">PL-08</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">]</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No Use of Flat Roof</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  - Access to\r\nthe flat roof of the development hereby permitted shall be for maintenance or\r\nemergency purposes only, and the flat roof shall not be used as a roof garden,\r\nterrace, patio or similar amenity area.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 & D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024. </span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Construction Times (Minor Development)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - No demolition or construction work or ancillary\r\nactivities such as deliveries shall take place before 8am or after 6pm Mondays\r\n- Fridays inclusive, before 8am or after 1pm on Saturdays or at any time on\r\nSundays or Bank Holidays.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:  </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To safeguard the amenities of the area and\r\nthe occupiers of neighbouring properties and ensure compliance with the\r\nfollowing Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D14 and T7 of the\r\nLondon Plan 2021 and policies D12.1 & D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"
  ],
